      "lines": [
        "1 class in lib/ whose name does not follow PSR-4 below OCA\\Memories, the namespace the server derives from <namespace> of info.xml. The loader of the server does not find such a class.",
        "  lib/Command/Index.php:40 OCA\\Memories\\Command\\IndexOpts, by its path OCA\\Memories\\Command\\Index"
      ]
    },
